  "description": "When I told him my feelings, he replied, “I’ve always dreamed of a love straight out of a drama.” I thought he was just telling me to be a good boyfriend, but as we got closer, I finally understood what he meant — He wanted us to live out a true romance drama. But can I really play my part in his script called life?\n\n(Source: Manta)",
